            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "You look horrible. Did you pull an all-nighter?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "He's back. I saw it, and it couldn't have been anyone else... That light... It was Andoain's Arts!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Ah... so that's why you vanished in a puff of smoke yesterday afternoon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "He came to you directly, though?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "He wasn't there for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "When I was bringing the mixed-blood girl back to the Basilica... I bumped into a Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "A Sarkaz? Now, of all times? And in broad daylight on the streets of Laterano, too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "That's right... I went after the Sarkaz and told Ezell to take the girl back to the Basilica."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "I chased the Sarkaz all the way to the edge of Pagus Faber... but Andoain covered her with his Arts and she got away."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "As for Ezell, I thought he'd have made it to the Basilica by the evening."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "But he never made it. This is his terminal. It was stuck to the bottom of a vehicle transporting envoys."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Heh, our trainee kid's a good enough actor to fool you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#4$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "I doubt he was acting. Though it's true that I don't understand why he did it... Maybe... Andoain kidnapped him, too...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Fiammetta, I think you really ought to calm down a little."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "I'm calm. I'm calmer than I've been in the last eight years."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "But none of you ever told me what happened the day after I left."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "It was a simple mop-up mission... and it went so much better than we expected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "All I did was answer a call for backup... I left the rest of you for four hours..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "And by the time I got back to the ruins, it was all too late."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "I've already told you everything I could."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "What exactly did he get from the Lock and Key that gave him the nerve to do that to Lemuen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "I would tell you if I could... but I don't know myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Fiammetta, this is Laterano, the Lateran Basilica. We aren't running around ruins in the wilds of Kazdel anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "You need to get some rest, Fiammetta. How about I help you apply for some leave? If you don't use your annual leave, it just expires."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "Are you serious?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "The conference is in two days, and Andoain brought a Sarkaz here to Laterano to kidnap a mixed-blood Sankta girl. He might have even attacked an executor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "I really let my guard down this time... The Sarkaz clearly knew her way around Pagus Faber. They must've infiltrated Laterano a long time ago... What is that maniac planning this time?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "I'm serious. Calm down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "The old man's already heard about the Astray, and so has Velliv. I was working in the Basilica yesterday too\u2014Not that I like to think of meetings as work."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "In any case, Laterano is really not in as much danger as you think. Andoain's just a Sankta. He's not a monster with six eyes and four arms. If you really want to take him on, go lie down for two hours."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "We'll talk to Lemuen after that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mostima",
        "text": "Looks like you're not completely out of it just yet."
    },
    {
