            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "Did you get enough rest last night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "I'm very well-rested. Thank you for taking us in, senior."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "The Ecclesia Requietum's doors are always open, as long as you don't find it too depressing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "After all, both the living and the dead visit this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "Given the circumstances, we're fortunate enough to have a roof over our heads. Speaking of which, where is Cecelia?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "The girl you brought with you? The sisters told me that she slept very well last night. She must have been exhausted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "She's had a long day."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$dooropenquite"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Mister Ezell, Mister Friar. Good morning."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "Good morning, Cecelia. You're full of energy today."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Yeah... We have stuff to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "Hm...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I asked Mister Friar to help me with something."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "He told me that... there is a ceremony for the family of the dead... to say their goodbyes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I want to... say goodbye to Mamma..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "We will hold a funeral for Miss Feoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "I see... A funeral..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "It's both a way to pay the dead our respects and for us to find closure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "I'll help you, Cecelia."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "Allow me to thank you again, senior."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "No, not at all. It is my honor, actually."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "There is nothing more beautiful than finding the courage to take that step forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "She is still young, and already she is saying farewell to a loved one. Not many grown men can handle this journey she is about to take."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
