            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "(You...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(Put your gun down. This is a heartfelt reunion.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(It is no different from the countless emotional meetings that have taken place across the land.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "musicvolume",
        "params": {
            "volume": 0.4,
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "I knew it... It's you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Cotton Candy Lady, I didn't get to talk to you yesterday."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I actually really, really wanted to! But I don't know why... everyone started to fight..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Your horns look just like Pap\u00e0's. So pretty!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#11$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "I wish I had horns like Pap\u00e0 too... I'm jealous."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "Hehe... Really? But your halo is very pretty."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "It's so bright that I sometimes can't sleep at night! It helps me read storybooks, though..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Cotton Candy Lady, are you from the same place as Pap\u00e0? Why can't Pap\u00e0 live in the city? Why aren't there other Sarkaz in Laterano?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_352_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia",
        "text": "Oh... My name is Cecelia!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_363_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "Hello, Cecelia. Call me... Rosella."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "(Friar... Why is there a Sarkaz here?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(Sarkaz... No Sarkaz have ever been allowed to set foot in our holy Lateran City.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(But then, what is Cecelia?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(Let's go. Give them some space.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "(What are you people trying to accomplish?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "(We're only... seeking our path forward.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
