    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Devout Follower",
        "text": "Good morning, Guide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_001"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pondering Follower",
        "text": "Salutations, Guide."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_065#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Smiling Follower",
        "text": "May God bless you and keep you, Guide."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "They call you their guide?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Friar",
        "text": "I don't presume to be any sort of guide or leader. You may call me by my name, Andoain."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "If being a leader helps my brothers and sisters feel at ease and points them in a direction, then I am willing to serve as their Guide. That's all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "I hope that's all it is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "I know what you're thinking."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "The mastermind of a heretical cult, lurking in the shadows of Laterano to lead its citizens astray. A man plotting a shocking conspiracy during this important conference that the city spent so much time to prepare?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "No, we wish only to throw open the doors."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "To those who are rejected, harmed, insulted, and desecrated."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "The Ecclesia Requietum will open its doors to them all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "But both you and I are 'angels.' They are not. The sacred cathedrals and churches of the Sankta have no place for them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Look at this old man. The Ursus hammering away at the coffin. He lost his family, his friends, his land, and his home during the war. What does he have to rely on, to believe in? Where can he find comfort and salvation?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "After a long journey, he made his way here to Laterano, the land of peace and radiance he heard about from passing travelers."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "But what did this place offer him? How did the glorious Lateran City treat this foreigner who had long been a toy of fate's cruelty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "See the Caprinae woman watering the herbs? She was branded a whore and a blasphemer for offending a noble, only barely escaping her home when it was set alight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "All she wanted was peace and quiet, or, if fate would allow her a bit of luxury, a brief moment of leisure and joy every now and then. Do you think the saints in the Basilica will think her their sister?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "To these men and women, our glorious Lateran citizens might perhaps offer them a sympathetic smile, perhaps even passionately hear their woes, maybe even open up their wallets to show their kindness and virtue."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Yet, to the Sankta, all of this will always be somebody else's problem."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "As for the Sarkaz, the 'cursed devils,' the 'crafty devils...' The 'devils' have never had a choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Our hatred of them has lasted thousands of years. For as long as history books go back, the Sankta and the Sarkaz have been slaughtering one another. The origin of this conflict is long gone. Our mutual hatred has become common sense."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Father and son slay father and son. Sisters murder sisters. The Sarkaz attack Sankta caravans for sport, while the Sankta shoot their Sarkaz enemies through the chest with greatest pride."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We are only ever concerned with how we see them, yet we are never interested in how they see us. Vengeance for vengeance grew into custom, and those customs eventually became tradition."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "But, if you are willing to spend the night with them under the same roof, you will find that their joys and sorrows are no different from ours."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "They rejoice when reunited, they weep when one passes, they tease their friends, and they grow bashful when they fall in love. Some of them love drink, others love song. Some of them even choose to dedicate their lives to their faith."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "How are they any different from us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "In Laterano, even the most devout Liberi friars who carefully follow the Church's teachings, who dutifully carry out their tasks in each ceremony, even those who are made saints and created cardinals..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "The Church has never truly accepted them. The Liberi are only there to lend a helping hand. They are tools to be used in the Church's day-to-day affairs."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "They don't have halos, which means they... heh, they aren't 'chosen,' they aren't Sankta."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Laterano is a place of peace and beauty, a place full of joy and laughter, but only we are deserving of this 'grace.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "What you're saying... is apostasy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Young executor, let me ask you. Why\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Why are the Sankta the only ones allowed happiness?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "You know who Cecelia is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We've known for years. She's the child of a Sankta and a Sarkaz. If grace actually existed, she would be it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "So you're trying to kidnap Cecelia now because of the conference?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We are not concerned with the conference at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "We came to take Cecelia now because, as a child, she should be by her mother's side."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "As soon as we are done with what we came here for, we will leave Laterano."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ezell",
        "text": "What are you trying to accomplish?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "You seem very tense. First things first, we must hold a funeral for Cecelia's mother."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Do you see the place up ahead with all the flowers? That's where the gravesite is. Tomorrow, that's where Feoria will be buried."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "If all are equal when they pass\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_351_1#5$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Andoain",
        "text": "Then so should they be when they live."
    },
    {
