    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Come out."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_373_1#1$1",
            "fadetime": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Executor Federico."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_279_excu_4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Your Excellency, if I may ask, did you provide the Sarkaz with a path to infiltrate Laterano? If indeed you did, I would be required to take you in to the relevant Tribunal of the Lateran Curia for questioning."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_373_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Must we make things so difficult between us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_279_excu_4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "I suggest you cooperate with the Notarial Hall. Should you resist arrest, regulations stipulate that I can and will temporarily suspend your rights as a Lateran citizen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_373_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "How exactly do you explain this encounter of ours with canon laws and teachings?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Should we interpret it as a test, or does it mean we have lost our way?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Or perhaps... losing our way is part of the test?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
